<td><a href="http://www.knf.gov.pl/dla_rynku/PODMIOTY_rynku/Podmioty_rynku_kapitalowego/index.html">Polish link</a><br><a href="http://www.knf.gov.pl/en/about_the_market/Capital_market/entities/Investment_fund_management_co.html">English link</a></td>
