<tr>
<td>Slovakia (Central Bank of Slovakia)</td>
<td><a href="http://www.nbs.sk/sk/dohlad-nad-financnym-trhom/dohlad-nad-trhom-cennych-papierov/kolektivne-investovanie/zoznam-dohliadanych-subjektov/zoznam-tuzemskych-spravcovskych-spolocnosti-a-ich-podielovych-fondov">Slovak link</a><br><a href="http://www.nbs.sk/en/financial-market-supervision/securities-market-supervision/collective-investment/list-of-supervised-entities/list-of-domestic-management-companies-and-their-mutual-funds">English link</a></td>
